1
00:00:00,159 --> 00:00:01,659
(loud crunching)

2
00:00:07,066 --> 00:00:08,696
(Sheldon:)Isn't this nice?

3
00:00:08,701 --> 00:00:09,971
(door opens)

4
00:00:09,969 --> 00:00:11,369
(Leonard:)Hey, we're here.

5
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,570
Alfred!

6
00:00:12,571 --> 00:00:14,271
(Penny:)Thank you for coming!
Oh.

7
00:00:14,273 --> 00:00:15,673
(Alfred:)Well, happy to be here.

8
00:00:15,674 --> 00:00:17,504
(Alfred:)And congratulations.
Thank you.

9
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:18,910
(Leonard:)Dad, you remember Sheldon.

10
00:00:18,911 --> 00:00:19,881
(Sheldon:)Dr. Hofstadter.

11
00:00:19,879 --> 00:00:21,349
(Alfred:)Dr. Cooper.

12
00:00:21,347 --> 00:00:22,977
(Leonard:)This is Sheldon's mother, Mary.
How do you do?

13
00:00:22,982 --> 00:00:24,182
(Mary:)Nice to meet you.

14
00:00:24,183 --> 00:00:25,353
(Leonard:)And his girlfriend, Amy.

15
00:00:25,351 --> 00:00:26,951
(Alfred:)A pleasure.
Hi.

16
00:00:26,952 --> 00:00:28,182
(Leonard:)And, of course, Mom.

17
00:00:28,187 --> 00:00:30,387
(Alfred:)Hello, my hateful shrew.

18
00:00:33,459 --> 00:00:36,999
(Beverly:)Hello to you,
you wrinkled old bastard.

19
00:00:39,231 --> 00:00:42,871
(Sheldon:)All right, now I'm starting
to sense a little tension.

20
00:00:48,965 --> 00:00:50,765
(Leonard:)All right, you two, don't start.

